### Banking Transactions API — sample requests
### Run top-to-bottom against: npm run dev  (http://localhost:3000)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Deposit to ACC-AAAAA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "EXTERNAL",
  "toAccount": "ACC-AAAAA",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### 3. Deposit EUR to ACC-BBBBB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "EXTERNAL",
  "toAccount": "ACC-BBBBB",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### 4. Transfer USD from ACC-AAAAA to ACC-BBBBB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-AAAAA",
  "toAccount": "ACC-BBBBB",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### 5. Failed withdrawal (insufficient funds on fresh account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-CCCCC",
  "toAccount": "EXTERNAL",
  "amount": 9999.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### 6. List all transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions

### 7. List transactions for ACC-AAAAA
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?accountId=ACC-AAAAA

### 8. Get ACC-AAAAA balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/ACC-AAAAA/balance

### 9. Get ACC-AAAAA summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/ACC-AAAAA/summary

### 10. Export CSV for ACC-AAAAA
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/export?accountId=ACC-AAAAA
